      "source": [
        "# label_df was already built in the streaming pass above -- no re-reading needed.\n",
        "match_died_ever = (label_df['folder_label'] == label_df['died_ever'].astype(int)).mean()\n",
        "match_died_30day = (label_df['folder_label'] == label_df['died_30day'].astype(int)).mean()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"folder_label vs died_ever  : {match_died_ever:.1%} match\")\n",
        "print(f\"folder_label vs died_30day : {match_died_30day:.1%} match\")\n",
        "\n",
        "mismatch = label_df[(label_df['folder_label'] == 1) & (~label_df['died_30day'])]\n",
        "print(f\"\\n{len(mismatch)} folder='died' patients did NOT die within 30 days of their last operation:\")\n",
        "mismatch[['subject_id', 'n_operations']]\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 9,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "WdYrLNTOSTX3",
        "outputId": "756b7256-a091-419d-f014-fa2871056f4e"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Corrected labels: 469 died / 99417 survived (0.5% mortality) -- pos_weight = 211.98\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "# true_label was already computed at the end of the streaming pass (Cell above) --\n",
        "# this cell just re-displays it for reference. (docs/index.md §4 decision: use\n",
        "# died_30day(), not the raw folder name.)\n",
        "n_died = sum(true_label.values())\n",
        "n_total = len(true_label)\n",
        "print(f\"Corrected labels: {n_died} died / {n_total - n_died} survived \"\n",
        "      f\"({n_died/n_total:.1%} mortality) -- pos_weight = {(n_total - n_died)/max(n_died,1):.2f}\")\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "63vEcy-HSTX3"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 4. Multi-operation sensitivity check\n",
        "*(research doc §2.2 — last-operation vs. first-operation vs. exclude)*\n",
        "\n",
        "Computes the 30-day label three different ways for every multi-operation patient in the\n",
        "subset, so you can see directly where the definitions disagree. On this 30-patient subset\n",
        "this is a **mechanism check**, not a statistically meaningful comparison — re-run this\n",
        "exact cell once the full 99,886-patient cohort is loaded to get a real answer.\n"
      ]
    },
